        "cartridge_pack_terms_heading": "Terms & Conditions",
        "cartridge_pack_terms": "<p>This pack is the cartridge bundle for the plan you picked. The count always follows Plan Features, so if that copy changes, this box updates with it.</p><p>Cartridge 1 ships with your order. The rest are home delivered a few days before each 6 month swap. Scale-O tracks the cycle and reminds you when an exchange is due. Delivery and exchange stay included in the plan price.</p><p>Cost per cartridge is this plan price split across the pack. You pay once. No extra cartridge bill later.</p><p><strong>Refund.</strong> Ask within 7 days if the order is undelivered or missing. Unused product in original packing can be sent back for a refund. Once the guarantee is activated, refunds stop and only replacement applies.</p><p><strong>Replacement.</strong> Flag damage within 24 hours of delivery. If a cartridge expires before 6 months, send photo and video proof. Activate the guarantee on our site after install. No activation, no replacement.</p><p>Read the full <a href=\"/pages/refurnd-policy\" title=\"Refund policy\">refund policy</a> and <a href=\"/pages/exchange-policy\" title=\"Replacement policy\">replacement policy</a>.</p>"
